  "description": {
   "en": "5 years after Darth Vader's death, peace has not yet arrived in the galaxy, and the remnants of the Empire have been moving behind the scenes. A lone bounty hunter, the Mandalorian, survives on his own path in such a chaotic era. He meets an orphan with mysterious power, the Child, and gets involved in an epic battle, now under attack from all over the galaxy.\n___\n**Supervisor:** [Lucasfilm](https://mangadex.org/author/a8528ac0-88e3-4826-9f54-5ac66e213681)"
